Z||000010||tiacPaul||02-01-2000||07:15 PM||||Fuel filters are cheap and easy. So it is always a good place to start.  Rough idle could also be from dirty fuel injection.  It is great for preformance to have this cleaned.  Also look at ignition coil and spark plugs.||||reg||12
